.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-init 1  "swarm 0.1.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-init \- Create a repo key and publish the first manifest
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm init\fR [\fB\-\-object\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a repo key and publish the first manifest
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-object\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Object format for a newly created git repo
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
